Package: ShinyCellModular
Title: ShinyCellModular: Modular Shiny App for Single Cell Data
    Exploration
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Laura", "Perlaza-Jimenez", , "laura.perlaza-jimenez@monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modular version of ShinyCell developed at the Monash
    Genomics and Bioinformatics Platform (MGBP). Each module is a
    self-contained tab in the app. Supports large scRNAseq and multimodal
    datasets with fast on-demand HDF5 access, extended visualisations,
    improved filtering, and publication-ready plots. Its modular structure
    makes it flexible, scalable, and easy to customise.
